<title>USA: FaxSav Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>FaxSav Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, N.J. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>For three months ended  For the year ended</p>
<p>						 December 31  December 31</p>
<p>						 (unaudited)  (unaudited)</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			    $3,821  $3,332 $15,036 $11,649</p>
<p> Net loss			   (2,094) (1,305) (7,476) (4,085)</p>
<p> (pro forma in 1995)	     (0.21)  (0.14)  (0.84)  (0.44)</p>
<p>Shares used in computing net</p>
<p> loss per share		     9,916   9,243   8,858   9,243</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except for per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The earnings per share for 1995 are pro forma to reflect the 1996 initial public offering in which all of the outstanding preferred stock was converted into common stock and then all of the common stock was reverse split nine shares to one.</p>
</text>
